1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,305
At 12:15 AM on September 26,

2
00:00:02,385 --> 00:00:08,439
1983, a red siren illuminated
a top-secret Soviet bunker outside Moscow.

3
00:00:08,519 --> 00:00:13,124
The radar screens confirmed what every officer dreaded:

4
00:00:13,204 --> 00:00:17,810
five American nuclear warheads were already in the air.

5
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:23,500
Soviet protocol gave Lieutenant Colonel Stanislav Petrov
exactly twenty minutes to authorize a retaliatory strike...

6
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:30,270
...that would wipe three hundred million people
off the face of the Earth.

7
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:32,614
He had a direct line to the Kremlin.

8
00:00:32,694 --> 00:00:35,741
His finger hovered over the confirmation switch.

9
00:00:35,821 --> 00:00:37,825
But instead of following orders...

10
00:00:37,905 --> 00:00:39,910
Petrov decided to trust a hunch.
